WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:08.940
I can't return to Academia 
until I defeat that Xyz user!

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.700
Sora?

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.360
Sora!

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.360
What happened?

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.620
What just happened?

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.060
He returned to the Fusion Dimension.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.400
Returned?

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:33.630
Ute said that this world was split into 
four: Fusion, Synchro, Xyz and Standard.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:42.100
Fusion Dimension's Academia is invading 
Heartland, Ute's hometown in the Xyz Dimension.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.430
I don't know anything about dimensions.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.560
But there's one thing I do know!

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.560
Dueling isn't a tool for war!

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.400
What is it?

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.240
You're...

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:09.360
You!

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:11.450
I finally found you!

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:13.320
I've been looking for you!

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.840
There are two people who look like me?

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.830
Aren't there any other cameras in the park?

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:26.700
They're too far away, so 
we can't see the target!

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.120
Since Sora Shiunin went back 
to the Fusion Dimension,

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:32.400
he may have returned with reinforcements!

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.570
Let me go!

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:37.740
Raise the energy detection 
levels around the central park.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:42.880
If many duelists invade 
simultaneously, we'll detect them.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.550
No!  They can act while 
you're still observing!

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.200
This is my city.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:50.960
I decide how to protect it.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:57.900
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:03.100
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.100
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.310
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.060
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.730
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:18.530
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:29.620
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:35.090
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:40.720
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:44.860
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.770
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.130
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:58.380
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.840
Because I don't want to give up

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:06.850
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:13.920
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:24.430
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.110
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:29.810
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.630
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.380
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:45.000
Destiny Starts to Move

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:56.620
Why does he also look like me?

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:07.190
We didn't finish our fight last 
time because others interfered.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.660
But if it's one-on-one, I won't lose!

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:12.120
Duel me!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.400
I promise to crush you this time!

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:19.370
Fine.  I'll duel you, you Fusion minion!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.340
Fusion minion?

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:24.960
My name isn't “fusion!”  My name is Hugo!
(Note: His name sounds like "fusion" in Japanese.)

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.310
Don't make that mistake!

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.800
Hugo?

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.750
Duel Mode on.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.320
Autopilot standby.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.260
Here I go!

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.560
Duel!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.420
I'll go first and win!  My turn!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.260
When there are no monsters on my field,

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:56.740
I can Special Summon Speedroid 
Terrortop from my hand.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:06.050
That motorcycle is his Duel Disk?

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:12.660
Next, I summon the Level 3 Tuner Monster 
Speedroid Tri-Eyed Dice from my hand!

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.630
Tuner Monster?  That means...

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:23.600
Level 3 Tri-Eyed Dice 
tunes Level 3 Terrortop!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:32.180
Cross-shaped magical sword, slice 
all your enemies with your power!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.650
Synchro Summon!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:38.750
Appear, Level 6 Hi-Speedroid Kendama!

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.590
We've detected summoning energy!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:41.850
Is it Fusion?

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:44.600
No, it's Synchro!

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.590
And it's unbelievably powerful!

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:47.920
What?

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.730
Synchro Summon?

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.970
A Synchro Monster?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.860
There's also a Synchro Dimension.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.470
Is he from...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.130
I activate Kendama's effect.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:08.200
Once per turn, I can banish 
a Speedroid from my graveyard

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.420
to deal 500 points of damage!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:20.360
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:22.840
Hugo is a Synchro user.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:25.560
But isn't Ute's enemy the Fusion Dimension?

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.830
My turn!

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:32.240
I summon The Phantom Knights 
of Ragged Gloves from my hand.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.360
When there's a Level 3 
Phantom Knight on my field,

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:43.640
I can Special Summon The Phantom 
Knights of Silent Boots from my hand.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:49.700
I overlay Level 3 The Phantom Knights 
of Ragged Gloves and Silent Boots!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.860
The souls of the fallen 
knights on the battlefield,

00:06:56.400 --> 00:07:00.300
resurrect and become the light 
that cuts through the darkness!

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.130
Xyz Summon!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.770
Appear, Rank 3 The Phantom 
Knights of Break Sword!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.210
We've also detected powerful 
Xyz Summon energy!

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:13.180
Xyz this time?  What's going on?

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:16.150
Fusion's minion has appeared!

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:17.500
Minion?

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:20.420
Fusion has a minion in Synchro Dimension.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:23.660
Ute must be battling him right now!

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.500
Let me go!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.930
I can't allow that.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:27.940
What?

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:31.350
Even if you're telling the truth,

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:35.830
it's not certain that the 
Synchro Dimension is our enemy.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:40.610
Provoking them and turning them 
into our enemy is not a good plan.

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:45.720
When a monster uses Ragged 
Gloves to Xyz Summon,

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:49.460
it gains 1000 attack points 
until the end of that turn.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:53.660
Let's battle!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:57.060
Go, Break Sword!  Attack Kendama!

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.000
Whoa!  I better watch out!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:10.400
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:14.610
Break Sword's attack points return to normal.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:18.920
Damn!  How dare you do that!

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:22.550
I'll pay you back double - 
no - a hundred times over!

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:25.980
My turn!

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:31.360
I activate the spell card Speed Recovery!

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.380
I Special Summon one Speedroid 
from my graveyard!

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:36.830
Resurrect, Kendama!

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:43.640
When I use Speed Recovery, I 
can't Normal Summon that turn.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:46.660
But I have enough to destroy your monster!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:53.650
Let's battle!  Kendama attacks Break Sword!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:02.580
I flip over my Continuous 
Trap Phantom Knights' Sword!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:06.120
Break Sword gains 800 attack points!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:11.230
Break Sword now has more 
attack points than Kendama!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.200
Don't underestimate me!

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:16.620
I'll also activate a trap!  Speed Turn!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:20.780
It switches Break Sword to defense position, 
and it loses 500 defense points!

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.730
Your monster is finished!

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.180
I don't think so.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.280
Break Sword's isn't destroyed in battle

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:33.150
by destroying Phantom 
Knights' Sword in its place.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.400
But Kendama can deal piercing damage.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:40.780
It has 2200 attack points while 
Break Sword has 500 defense points.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:43.630
You take 1700 points of piercing damage!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.080
What an impact!

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:00.580
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.630
Ute!

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:12.790
My turn!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:16.760
I switch Break Sword from 
defense to attack position.

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:20.400
I summon The Phantom Knights 
of Ancient Cloak from my hand!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.460
I activate Ancient Cloak's effect!

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.240
By switching it to defense position,

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:31.060
Break Sword gains 800 attack 
points until the end of the turn!

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:36.150
Let's battle!  Break Sword attacks Kendama!

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:42.900
If I use Tri-Eyed Dice's effect from 
the graveyard, I can negate the attack.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:43.590
However...

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.770
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:57.200
Break Sword's attack points return to normal.

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:01.470
You duel quite well.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:05.560
I won't lose against a Fusion minion.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.820
Like I said, my name is Hugo!

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:11.770
Stop saying “fusion” over and over!

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.820
You annoy me!

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:18.170
Not only did you steal something important 
from me, but you keep getting my name wrong!

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.180
You're the one who stole from me!

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.430
Be quiet!  We'll talk after I defeat you!

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:27.880
My turn!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:32.520
I summon Speedroid Double Yoyo from my hand.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:40.680
When it's summoned, I can Special Summon 
one Speedroid from my graveyard.

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:45.220
I Special Summon the Level 3 
Tuner Monster Tri-Eyed Dice!

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:52.420
I know that you want to battle him too.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.640
I'll bring you out now.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:55.770
Here I go!

00:11:55.770 --> 00:12:00.700
Level 3 Tri-Eyed Dice 
tunes Level 4 Double Yoyo!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:11.840
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings to 
strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:13.800
Synchro Summon!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:19.120
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:25.010
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon?

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.410
Synchro Summon!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:34.730
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.610
Hugo also has a dragon?

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:42.310
Let's battle!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:46.750
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon, 
attack Break Sword!

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:06.870
Whirlwind Hell Dive Slasher!

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:16.380
Ute!

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:17.680
Stay away!

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.170
Break Sword's effect activates!

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.380
When this monster leaves the field,

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:28.300
I Special Summon the monsters that were 
used to summon it as Level 4 monsters!

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:37.000
Since they're back, I'll get rid 
of the one that I don't like.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.750
The spell card Shock Surprise!

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:45.640
I banish Speedroid Double Yoyo from 
my graveyard to destroy Ancient Cloak!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.340
I end my turn.

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:53.460
You know why I left you those two monsters.

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:58.780
Summon it.  My Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon is waiting for it!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:03.840
I know I arrived here because 
my dragon guided me here.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:07.310
The same thing led me to Heartland.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.830
Let's finish it this time.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:15.130
Call forth your Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:16.640
Finish it...

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.840
My turn!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:25.740
I overlay Level 4 Ragged 
Gloves and Silent Boots!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.410
From the black darkness,

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:35.790
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:37.520
Xyz Summon!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:42.420
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:57.080
What am I feeling?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.650
My chest feels hotter than before.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.290
Ute?

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:12.660
Fine.  I'll end this.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:20.980
My Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon will 
destroy you... destroy everything!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:23.200
Ute!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:28.080
I activate Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:34.810
By using one Overlay Unit, your Level 
5-or-above monster's attack points are halved,

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:38.080
and Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon gains that amount!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.290
Treason Discharge!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:46.090
That effect lowers Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon's attack points to 1250.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:51.850
And Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's 
attack points rise to 3750.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.630
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's effect activates!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.280
When a Level 5-or-above monster 
is the target of an effect,

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:03.740
that effect is negated, and the monster 
that activated it is destroyed!

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.980
Negated and destroyed?

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.750
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's effect

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:13.690
activated on Clear Wing Synchro Dragon, 
so it's negated and destroyed!

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:16.060
Dichroic Mirror!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.860
I activate the trap Phantom Knights' Wing!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:25.280
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon isn't destroyed, 
and it gains 500 attack points!

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:29.800
Not only did he avoid destruction, 
but he also raised its attack points!

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:34.540
I'll destroy you... everything...

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:37.240
Ute?

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:41.460
Destroy everything...  Burn everything...

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:43.150
Hugo?

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:46.480
I'll destroy everything!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:50.280
What are you talking about?  Stop it!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:54.590
Don't use dueling to unleash your hatred!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:59.500
Go and battle, Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.250
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon-

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.070
Stop it!

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:05.970
This isn't a duel!  I won't accept it!

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:11.280
A duel is supposed to make 
people smile and become happy!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:15.550
A duel isn't something 
you use to hurt people!

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:21.320
Even you said that dueling 
in your hometown of Heartland

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.990
caused it to overflow with smiles!

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:36.440
I don't want to hurt anyone anymore.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.440
Ute.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.040
Ute!

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:45.100
I end my turn.

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:46.720
My turn!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:53.400
I summon Speedroid Razorang from my hand!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.090
You have to stop too!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:03.170
I activate Razorang's effect.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:06.200
Once per turn, by switching 
it to defense position,

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:09.940
one monster loses 300 attack points.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.780
Dark Rebellion currently 
has 3000 attack points.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.410
Even if you lower it by 300 points...

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.660
I lower Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon's attack points!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.650
What?

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:24.880
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's 
effect now activates!

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:29.680
Since a Level 5-or-above monster is the 
target of an effect, that effect is negated,

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:31.820
and Razorang is destroyed!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.290
Dichroic Mirror!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:36.310
So you're going to stop fighting too!

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:41.620
And Clear Wing gains attack points equal 
to the destroyed monster's attack points!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:42.770
What?

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:46.710
Let's battle!

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:52.540
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon attacks 
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:59.620
Whirlwind Hell Dive Slasher!

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:08.690
Yuya!

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.440
Ute!

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:22.580
Are you okay, Ute?

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:36.140
Huh?  What did I do?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:38.800
What?

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:46.130
Ute, hang in there!  Are you okay?

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:54.800
Make people smile by dueling.

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:04.280
Use your power to bring smiles 
to the world and the future.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.260
My power?

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:21.720
My bracelet is glowing again.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.630
Was Ute here?

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:39.420
Yuya!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.120
Yuya!

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:48.030
Yuya!

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:50.600
Yuya?

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:55.360
What's wrong?  What happened?

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:57.200
Pull yourself together, Yuya!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:59.330
Yuya!

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:11.180
I found what appears to be a Xyz 
Dimension Duel Disk at the site.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.100
Retrieve it and bring it me.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:15.300
Understood.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:46.560
By analyzing the memories of the 
agent that I sent to Standard,

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:49.020
I found very interesting information.

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:57.480
She is the fourth piece that 
I've been searching for.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:00.300
Her name is Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:06.240
Bring her to me, Joeri.

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:34.880
As long as there's a smile

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:41.660
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:46.960
I always believe

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:50.480
In my tomorrow

00:22:50.830 --> 00:22:56.110
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:22:59.380 --> 00:23:04.750
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:11.620
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:18.290
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:22.360
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:51.410
Fusion, Synchro, Xyz.

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:53.960
And we live in the Standard Dimension.

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:58.730
Sora came from Fusion, and Ute 
and Kurosaki came from Xyz.

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:02.900
Is everything he told me that night true?

00:24:03.300 --> 00:24:08.860
Because I was holding the card 
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon.

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:13.560
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Four Dimensions

00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:16.160
The fun is only getting started!
